# Release binaries live here on disk but never in git history.
#
# One APK is ~132 MB and a bundle is comparable. Committing one per release
# would grow this repository by that much PERMANENTLY — git history cannot be
# slimmed after the fact without rewriting every commit that follows. The
# artefacts are reproducible (`eas build`) and EAS keeps every one of them for
# 30 days at a stable URL, which is recorded in artifacts/MANIFEST.md.
#
# Everything else in playstore/ — the listing copy, the data-safety answers,
# the signing facts, this manifest — IS committed, because that is the part
# that cannot be regenerated.
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
